    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Deliver the Apple to Newton's Head...</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rolling apple returns in this action-adventure sequel\u2014guide it through a series of unique stages to reach Newton himself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, jump, and brake your way through beautifully designed levels as you aim to prove the law of universal gravitation... by landing directly on Newton's head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Objective\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an apple and navigate toward Newton\u2019s head using movement, jumps, and precise braking. But be careful\u2014the apple is fragile. Each fall reduces its stamina, and when it runs out, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Worlds</strong>: Explore a dreamy and elegant stage design that feels as good as it looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Collectibles</strong>: Golden apples are hidden throughout the stages. Collect them all to uncover secrets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Team up with fellow apples and conquer challenges together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Estimated Playtime\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u20135 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We encourage you to stream or share videos of this game! If possible, please include a link to our store page when posting.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Deliver the Apple to Newton's Head...</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rolling apple returns in this action-adventure sequel\u2014guide it through a series of unique stages to reach Newton himself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, jump, and brake your way through beautifully designed levels as you aim to prove the law of universal gravitation... by landing directly on Newton's head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/6899f798ed9bcedf9e4f0b3ab7eecdc7.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Objective\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an apple and navigate toward Newton\u2019s head using movement, jumps, and precise braking. But be careful\u2014the apple is fragile. Each fall reduces its stamina, and when it runs out, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/bea483a3ed967df26032b845c7f3d200.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Worlds</strong>: Explore a dreamy and elegant stage design that feels as good as it looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Collectibles</strong>: Golden apples are hidden throughout the stages. Collect them all to uncover secrets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Team up with fellow apples and conquer challenges together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.poster.avif?t=1752530595\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.webm?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/2c98af58c5be9e542b8fa0a3624f3356.mp4?t=1752530595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Estimated Playtime\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u20135 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We encourage you to stream or share videos of this game! If possible, please include a link to our store page when posting.</p>",
